# Allowlist, not denylist: the image needs only what the Dockerfile COPYs.
# A denylist sent everything else to the Docker daemon on every local build,
# including gitignored model checkpoints and campaign output that can sit in a
# working copy (a DFloat11 checkpoint alone is ~19 GB; see .gitignore).
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!afterimage/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
